        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-clarity-return",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "We return to Odysseus’s journey. He had left Calypso on the raft he built, hoping to reach Ithaca."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The little sail had carried him for days. Now the water rose."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Odysseus held to the timber. His carefully tied knots strained beneath him."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-the-bindings-give",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 2500,
          "effects": {
            "view": "wreck",
            "raft": {
              "broken": 1,
              "y": 978
            },
            "actors": {
              "odysseus": {
                "x": 790,
                "y": 966,
                "facing": "front"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "A wave broke the raft apart. He came up beside the broken timber, still holding on."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "No sail now. No provisions. Only the next breath, and the one after it."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-follow-the-current",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 2500,
          "effects": {
            "raft": {
              "x": 850,
              "y": 980
            },
            "actors": {
              "odysseus": {
                "x": 815,
                "y": 968,
                "facing": "right"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He let the wood carry his weight. He could not fight every wave."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-reach-sheltered-ground",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 2600,
          "transition": {
            "kind": "shot",
            "durationMs": 1400,
            "reason": "Dissolve the complete sea shot, including Odysseus and the wreck, into his arrival on the river bank"
          },
          "effects": {
            "room": "river",
            "view": "shore",
            "basket": {
              "visible": 1
            },
            "raft": {
              "visible": 0
            },
            "swell": 0,
            "actors": {
              "odysseus": {
                "x": 700,
                "y": 946,
                "facing": "left",
                "pose": "walk",
                "bow": 1
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "At a sheltered river mouth, his feet found sand. For a moment, he could not make them move."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-a-few-steps-inland",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "odysseus": {
                "x": 730,
                "y": 945,
                "pose": "walk",
                "facing": "right",
                "bow": 0.65
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He took a few steps inland and lowered his head. The ground stayed beneath him."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s1-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He had reached another shore. He still did not know whose shore it was.",
          "pauseMs": 1800
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 84,
      "durationMs": 83380
    },
