              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-rest-the-lyre",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 650,
          "effects": {
            "view": "song",
            "actors": {
              "demodocus": {
                "seated": 1,
                "pose": "sit",
                "facing": "left"
              }
            },
            "singing": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Demodocus settled the lyre against his knees. The hall grew quiet."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Demodocus sang about Troy, where Odysseus had fought. The song reminded the stranger of friends lost in that war."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "To the people listening, it was a story carried across the years."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "To Odysseus, it was a door that had never quite closed."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-lower-his-head",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1300,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "odysseus": {
                "bow": 1
              }
            },
            "tears": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He lowered his head. Tears reached his beard before he thought to hide them."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He remembered voices the song could not give back. Men who would never hear it."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The singer’s hands kept moving. Odysseus stayed still."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s4-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Then the king noticed what the song was costing his guest.",
          "pauseMs": 1800
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 61,
      "durationMs": 60490
    },
    {
      "id": "odyssey-c3-s5",
      "chapterId": "chapter-3",
      "name": "A Name at Last",
      "atmosphere": {
        "water": 0.003,
        "wind": 0.008,
        "birds": 0,
        "village": 0.001,
        "music": 0.006
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-frame",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1000,
          "effects": {
            "view": "name",
            "chapter": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-the-song-comes-to-rest",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 700,
          "effects": {
            "singing": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Alcinous asked the singer to rest. The last note faded."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "alcinous",
          "text": "“That song has found something in you. It need not continue.”",
          "listener": "odysseus"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Arete waited beside them. No one filled the silence for him."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-meet-their-eyes",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1000,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "odysseus": {
                "bow": 0,
                "facing": "right"
              }
            },
            "tears": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“I have been a guest in many places. Not all of them let me leave.”",
          "listener": "alcinous"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "alcinous",
          "text": "“We can prepare a ship. Tell us where it must take you.”",
          "listener": "odysseus"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Odysseus looked from the king to the queen. He had kept his name back long enough."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“I am Odysseus, son of Laertes. My home is Ithaca.”",
          "listener": "alcinous",
          "pauseMs": 1800
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "A name they had heard in songs now belonged to the tired man before them."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "odysseus",
          "text": "“But Troy was only the beginning of the journey.”",
          "listener": "alcinous"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-s5-p10",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Odysseus began telling the king and queen what had happened after Troy. The next part takes us back to those earlier years.",
          "pauseMs": 2100
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c3-end",
          "type": "end"
        }
      ],
